# Every suite writes here, and every suite wipes its own directory at start. 80 of these
# files (1.94 MB of .out/.err/.png/.json/SQLite .db) were tracked, and NO suite ever reads
# one back -- they were write-only, rewritten by every run. What that cost was legibility:
# they were 48 of the 49 lines in `git status`, so "what did I change" had no answer, which
# is how one session's Store.cs/Ver.cs/Daemon.cs work was swept into another session's
# commit (f9aaf25, whose own message admits the carry). Untracked 2026-08-18. This line
# supersedes the narrower daemon-*.out/.err pair that used to live here.
tests/*-output/
.claude/worktrees/
